# text_id = 1552
# text = I do not think that anybody will disagree with the idea at the back of the mind of the Chancellor of the Exchequer that a certain sum should clearly go to a reduction of Debt , but a Clause of this kind is of little value , because it is impossible for one Parliament to legislate to bind another Parliament .
