# text_id = 1560
# text = I think it is a tragedy that since the War on the whole the forces of nationalism in public opinion have beaten the forces of internationalism , and that all our expedients have been taken rather as expedients to tide us over a short time than as an attempt to build up a world polity suitable to the present age .
