# text_id = 1564
# text = I have my own idea as to what the interpretation of the law would be in the case of messengers — I do not know whether the point has actually been before the courts — and that is that , whether you pay messengers or whether they work voluntarily , nevertheless messengers should be returned as one of the election expenses .
