# text_id = 1583
# text = One of the most reassuring things which emerges from reading these reports is that even in the boroughs in Lancashire , where , in view of the long - continued distress which many of these boroughs have suffered , one would have expected to find high rates of malnutrition and sub-nutrition among school children , actually one does not find that .
