# text_id = 1586
# text = I have not achieved all that I would like to have accomplished , but I hope I have cleared up some of the points of contention arising from the complaints against the so - called abuses of the unemployment insurance system ; and when the anomalies come along , perhaps , Mr. Speaker , you will give me somewhat greater scope .
