# text_id = 1590
# text = Again , the adjustment of all inter-Governmental debts ( Reparations and other War Debts ) to the existing troubled situation of the world — and this adjustment should take place without delay if new disasters are to be avoided — is the only lasting step capable of re-establishing the confidence which is the very condition of economic stability and real peace .
