# text_id = 1605
# text = Aviation suffers from the very unfortunate position of having to be in the hands of the Air Ministry , of the Exchequer , and also of the Post Office , and it is when you have this divided control that you are in danger of having an incomplete , or at least an insufficiently speedy development of a service .
