# text_id = 1624
# text = I am as anxious as anybody to prevent accidents , and I very much oppose the idea of a thirty miles an hour speed limit , because it seems to me that that in built - up areas would cause long processions of cars following each other , nose to tail and attempting to pass each other within narrow limits .
