# text = I think the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Caithness and Sutherland ( Sir A. Sinclair ) has already pointed out that in many of our rural districts , and in the Highlands and Islands , despite the progress that has been made , some of the housing conditions are still abominable , deplorable , and altogether indefensible .
