# text = His Majesty 's representative at Barcelona was at once instructed , in reply , to point out that great care was taken by the Non-Intervention Committee , when drawing up the plan , to provide against the possibility of evasions of the kind suggested , and to invite the Spanish Government 's attention to the relevant provisions of the plan .
