# text_id = 1692
# text = If , incidentally , the provisions of Parts I and III of the Bill should prove beneficial to the railways to the extent that the competition between railways and road transport will become fairer , more equitable and more economical , then I submit that the railways are fully entitled to any such benefit that might accrue to them .
