# text = Up till March there were 2,406 housing schemes under the Housing ( Rural Workers ) Act , 1926 , and there are at present 1,637 under construction so that there are nearly as many houses under construction as had been constructed previously , thus proving that we are not slackening in pressure but are hacking up local authorities in the matter .
