# text_id = 1756
# text = Still I do think that the Government should give all heed to these and other considerations in a real honest , broadset desire to establish peace without going to what is called the bitter end , and it will be a bitter end , to make an honourable , lasting world peace without the slaughter of millions and millions more if we do not embrace some well - founded opportunity .
