# text = They may hope to sell their goods , not only in Russia , but in every country of the world , because we know the prestige that British machinery enjoys ; but for the British agriculturist there is only one market , and , if dumping is allowed in that market , he is knocked out of the only market in which he has a chance to sell anything .
