# text_id = 1760
# text = While we are carrying through these constructive measures — and they are constructive measures — for the betterment of the milk industry , it still remains essential to safeguard milk producers against the possible effects of a serious fall in the prices of imported milk products , which , of course , would reduce their returns and would prejudice their ability to carry through successfully the constructive part of the programme .
