# text = Although we may differ as to the method of bringing about that development , I think I can safely say that we are all anxious , even if we do not believe in what is called Empire Free Trade , for freer and more abundant trade between all parts of the Empire , and whatever can be done in that direction will have the co-operation and encouragement of the present Government .
