# text_id = 1770
# text = It is a tragic circumstance indeed that in an age of greater abundance than hitherto ever known to mankind there should be lacking through some inherent fault of the capitalist system the means of distributing through purchasing power these advantages of our modern industrial system , whereas paradoxically we find many millions of people in the world are suffering from undernourishment , as it were , in the midst of plenty .
