# text_id = 1771
# text = Speaking from my own experience , I know that the men have admired their officers and would have done anything for them , would have risked their lives for them and were prepared to make any sacrifice in order to play their part ; but I can recall other examples where discipline was enforced and the men did not respect the people who were enforcing the discipline but were resentful .
