# text = There must be thousands of men who have left the Service , thousands of naval officials who were " axed " and have retired since the War , whose knowledge is rusting with years , but who if they were given an opportunity of having short courses occasionally to modernise their nautical knowledge would form great potential reserves capable of jumping into the gap in the case of a sudden emergency .
