# text_id = 1776
# text = As has already been said by the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Hillhead ( Sir R. Horne ) and other hon . Members the coal industry differs from almost every other industry in the country , and one of the ways in which it differs is that it is less suitable , and not more suitable , for amalgamation than almost any other industry that can be imagined .
