# text = I , therefore , suggest to the Committee that , if they approve , I should , at the conclusion of the speeches of the Leaders of the two Oppositions , putfrom the Chair all the Budget Resolutions , and that the Committee should pass them with the exception of the last one , which will be left open in the usual way in order to keep the Debate open .
