# text_id = 1782
# text = And if , before this war broke out , the Government admitted , as they did , that voluntary effort could not cope with the influx of refugees from Germany and Czecho - Slovakia , how much more readily should they admit now that private purses , drained by war - time demands , cannot cope with the fresh influx of refugees who are victims of the war in Eastern Europe .
