# text_id = 1785
# text = The purpose of all this activity is to bring the schools and the industrial and business community into closer and more sympathetic touch with each other , and to build up a system which will give to our industries the highly trained designers and craftsmen of which they are in need , supported by a population taught and encouraged to appreciate and to demand things of good design and workmanship .
