# text_id = 1786
# text = I have felt for some time that there was a good deal of force in that argument , and that when the community is pressing on everyone to take a hand in providing shelters and protection it seemed odd , perhaps anomalous , if the expenditure which they incurred in answer to that pressure should actually increase the amount of tax which they have to pay under Schedule A .
