# text_id = 1787
# text = The reforms in procedure introduced by that Act and by the new Rules of Court are now being brought into full operation , and it is my considered opinion that any economy which might be effected by a reduction in the number of judges could only be secured at the cost of the impaired efficiency of the judicial machinery of Scotland and of material detriment to the public interest .
