# text = We thought , having waited until the Prime Minister came back , now that the conversations at Washington were over , now that the right hon . Gentleman knew the mind of the American President and now that other gentlemen have been to America too , there might be an opportunity for frank and full consultation with Members of the House of Commons and the people of the country .
