# text = First , I should like to refer to a Debate on this subject three weeks ago , and pay a tribute to the speech made by my right hon . Friend the Member for West Birmingham ( Sir A. Chamberlain ) who expressed in most cogent and convincing terms the view which , I believe , is entertained by the great majority of this House , on all benches .
