# text_id = 1798
# text = At the same time , we find under these agreements that the decisions of the Advisory Committee , which , after all was set up by Parliament , have been varied , and that the minimum duties which they considered to be necessary , if industries were to have security , have been further lowered in order to bring about certain results in the helping of our coal trade .
