# text_id = 1799
# text = No party has so many young Members as this , and if the Parliamentary Secretary to the Treasury really insists that the House shall devote its time at this hour to the consideration of important matters , we are prepared to consider them to the best of our ability , to see that they consider them too , and to sec that no public money is spent without proper scrutiny .
