# text_id = 1800
# text = These facts seem to reinforce the view which , though once re-rided , is gradually coming into favour , namely , that the present depression , though unduly severe , is of a normal character and is following the normal pattern , and that the initial stages of recovery have been due to the revival of enterprise , showing itself in the gradual increase of investment in fixed capital goods .
