# text = Throughout the speech of the right hon . Gentleman there were three points , the first directed to the interest of certain taxpayers who , he thought , are unjustly treated by the proposals of the Bill ; the second directed to the Land Values Tax and the third dealing with the financial structure of the Budget , particularly the point relating to the contribution in respect of unemployment insurance .
