# text_id = 1803
# text = I would impress on the Minister that , if it is humanly possible he should see to it that houses built by money from the building societies are not let at more than the standard rent of 8s. to 10s . a week and I would ask him seriously to consider the proposal for building communal dwellings and in that way dealing with the appalling problem of slum property .
