# text_id = 1805
# text = I now turn to administration , which , I confess , is of more interest to me at the moment than the programme , because it is not yet restricted by any international obligation , and I wish to tell the House of some economies in the naval service which we have been able to effect , and I hope that those economies will not be without general interest in themselves .
