# text = It may be , perhaps it is , impossible to make a satisfactory definition of an aggressor , but surely it would have been very helpful if this conference of jurists had laid down some general principles , some considerations which ought to be taken into account by any tribunal which may be set up to decide Whether the Pact has been violated by a particular State or not .
