# text_id = 1813
# text = So far as industrial property is concerned , or the value of land in industrial centres is concerned , I concede the point that the value of that land has been made by the activity of the people and by their joint action , but when we come to the question of rent , where a particular form of ownership produces rent which is to be taxed , a fallacy arises .
