# text_id = 1814
# text = We have nothing to gain by aggression and everything to gain by peace and tranquillity , but , as some of our finest naval experts have warned us , even 50 cruisers would be insufficient to do duty with the fleet as well as guarding and defending those 80,000 miles of trade routes which are the main arteries of the Empire and the mainstay of the life of this country .
