# text_id = 1816
# text = Of course , it is quite easy to pull any such proposal to pieces ; it is easy to find debating arguments like those put forward by the hon . Member for the Scotland Division ; but I am only anxious lest the House of Commons should show itself not only unsympathetic , but definitely hostile to a movement which has in it the germs of something extremely useful and valuable .
