# text = Therefore , we ought to approach the subject with care , and I was delighted that the Secretary of State refused to dogmatise about it and that he is keeping an open mind ; but I would certainly lay it down that an alteration in the Scottish system of boat ownership ought not to be a condition of help from the State in the re-organisation of the fishing fleet .
