# text = In imposing a 33 ⅓ per cent . duty on , say , blooms or billets , the intention is to increase the price , but , if these ship - plates are allowed to come into this country free of duty , our people who are paid on a sliding scale will not get any advantage whatever from any increase in the prices of other commodities produced in the industry .
