# text = Either manufactured goods which our unemployed are perfectly able to produce for our consumption would be kept out of the country by a revenue tariff , thereby giving employment to some of our unfortunate 2,500,000 people who are unemployed at the moment , or , if that were not the case , at least we should get revenue which would help to meet the financial obligations of the country .
