# text_id = 1825
# text = It is all very well to spend this money to provide room for ancient ghosts , but it would be better to provide new houses for living folk , and perhaps the Minister will explain how it is that when we are in such financial straits he can still afford £ 60,000 , when even half that money would be very useful to any of our constituencies to improve our housing .
