# text = The difficulty , the impossibility , of finding other sources of cultivation for 375,000 acres of land , finding employment for 40,000 men , of re-taming upon the land persons who are now there — the fear of not being able to do that has been of an overwhelming kind , and it would be ungracious at such a moment to look a gift horse too closely in the mouth .
