# text = I am not going to say one word on the merits of the particular instance which the hon . and gallant Member for South - East Leeds raised , because that is going to be dealt with to - morrow , but , in passing , I may say that I am not prepared to admit that because a Statute is old it is therefore either incomprehensible or bad .
