# text = It is important that in one part of the country there should be a reservoir of disease - free animals , not merely cows , but all animals , and that farmers should be able to come from other parts of England and Wales to buy their stock in West Wales , where , of course , we charge a perfectly reasonable figure for the animals which we sell .
