# text_id = 1840
# text = Therefore , one must assume that it is regarded as an alternative form of national service to military service , and as was said quite rightly by the right hon . Member for Sparkbrook ( Mr. Amery ) , one must imagine that this organisation which is being built up is to be put into operation as a living , working machine on the day that the emergency arises .
