# text = Secondly , having a hard - and - fast statement in the Resolution regarding full cargo charters may prevent tramp shipping , which , after all , has done a good deal for this country , from getting the benefit of a number of berth cargoes , which are legitimate tramp cargoes and which never interfere with the liners — I refer to the River Plate trade home on the berth .
