# text_id = 1845
# text = In order to avoid that possibility , the Deputy - Chairman and I propose that , after a reasonable time has been spent in discussing alterations to the Schedule as it stands , including proposals to omit things from the Schedule , we should then exercise our right of selection of Amendments by not selecting any more of those Amendments but should proceed to select Amendments proposing additions to the Schedule .
