# text = I am still not at all sure that in that opinion I am not right , but I realise the fact that the noble Lord himself , and I dare say many other noble Lords , disagree with me in my judgment on that point , and I am not therefore going to resist the Amendment if the noble Lord thinks this is the best way of dealing with the matter .
