# text_id = 1849
# text = If the hon . Member had just paid a short visit , either to the agricultural sections of Canada , to the wide open spaces of Australia , or to some of those unfortunate individuals over there who have lost every penny they ever accumulated either in this country or anywhere else , then perhaps he would change his views with regard to transferring people from this country to Australia .
