# text = There is one other matter connected with the herring industry I should like to touch on , and that refers to the new type of drifter which is being built , I think , in the constituency of my hon . and gallant Friend opposite ( Sir M. McKenzie Wood ) — drifters with Diesel engines , two of which , I understand , were built at Buckie last year .
