# text = I am perfectly willing to consult my right hon . and learned Friend the Attorney - General with regard to the interpretation that might be placed on the use of the word " disaffection , " but I would point out that there is ample precedent for the use of the word " disaffection " both in Defence of the Realm Regulations and in Acts on the Statute Book .
