# text_id = 1871
# text = We have had in times past expansion schemes put up to the Committee of Imperial Defence by the Air Ministry , sat upon , brooded over , and then , when political panic ensued , promoted probably by the right hon . Member for Epping , suddenly thrown back to the Ministry with orders to get on with it quickly , with the result that you have had hurry without efficiency .
