# text_id = 1873
# text = I have no doubt the Government will gain the assent of the House to the prosecution of that policy , but I would remind them that the strength of the country does not in the end depend merely upon the number of your forces , or even the equipment which those forces have , but upon the goodwill and determination of the people of the country in an emergency .
