# text_id = 1874
# text = I believe that the system worked well , and although I do not wish to make any criticism about it , because it appears to me to be a matter of terminology , I confess that I a little regret that when the new appointment was made the new Minister was not called Assistant Secretary of State in charge of League of Nations Affairs , or something of that kind .
