# text = The taxpayers would have suffered considerably , because the economies would have been put off for many years , and when the time came for handing over the lease , the taxpayers , again , would have had to pay , probably , heavy dilapidation charges , instead of receiving , as they are to receive , a substantial sum for surrendering the lease four years before its time .
