# text = While we are generally grateful that , in spite of the shift of population , and , in some areas , of the decline in the school population , the security of tenure of teachers has been maintained , I would emphasise the fact that there is a growing and an aggravated problem among those students who are coming from the universities and the colleges at this particular time .
