# text = I consider that in order that at all times and in all conditions the assets of the Issue Department — that is to say , the backing of our currency — should be consistently and conservatively valued , the gold in each return should be valued at the old par , and all the foreign exchange assets should be valued at the current rate of exchange irrespective of their purchase price .
