# text = I ask hon . Members opposite to apply the knowledge , to which I paid a sincere tribute in the opening words of my speech , which they can contribute to debates of this sort to the position which I have endeavoured to point out , and ask themselves whether what they are asking for is going to help , is going to be worth it in the end .
