# text_id = 1890
# text = The Home Secretary is not in his place at the moment , but I am not aware that the right hon . Gentleman is ready to admit that he presides over a nest of forgers and that those confident officials and responsible persons who come to him every day , and with whom he has these relations , are in fact guilty of an odious and dishonest transaction of this character .
