# text_id = 1891
# text = When you are setting up native district boards , when you are establishing the directing influence of the central government through small local authorities , you are not only giving those people a real voice in the Government , and an incentive to govern themselves well , but you are teaching them how to govern themselves , an advantage which they can never get under the French administrative system .
