# text = I had not intended to intervene in the debate because I took part in the last discussion in the House on this subject , but , in view of the speech which has just been delivered by the hon . Member for Horncastle ( Mr. Haslam ) , I should like to make it clear that the views he has expressed do not represent the unanimous opinion of agriculturists .
