# text = I appreciate the importance of what he said on the matter , and I suggest that the process of submitting schemes by local authorities in consultation with the Home Office experts and their approval by the Secretary of State will , in fact , result in the graduation of different schemes to suit local needs , not necessarily one or four or 15 categories but a great number of categories .
