# text_id = 1894
# text = The manufacturers of this country who , under the heavy burden of taxation , are competing with foreign nations have to find the bulk of the wherewithal to meet the requirements of the National Exchequer , and if instances such as we are discussing to - day , to the prejudice of the manufacturing industries of this country , are to continue it will be a sad story for this country .
