# text_id = 1896
# text = It is a remarkable testimony to the strength of Tariff Reform that in fact the only thing he has done , in this so - called Free Trade Budget , is to increase the protective duties which are to be placed upon a certain product coming into this country ; and he has not even , as in the case of the Silk Duty , charged a corresponding excise .
