# text_id = 1902
# text = I do not know whether an Amendment would be necessary to enable the Welfare Fund to contribute to the adequate maintenance of schemes , but it seems to me that it would be a very reasonable thing , when spending capital upon a scheme , to acid a certain sum for maintenance — say , half the amount required for maintenance , leaving the locality to provide the other half .
