# text = The mere fact that they find themselves ruined only means that they and many others will be ruined by their rash action in . voting for the National Government , but , in their particular case , we see at once the effect of rash and hurried legislation which plunges a rough hand into the complicated business of the City of London and the great trading centres of this country .
