# text_id = 1907
# text = He rather attracted me by his reference to himself and his friends as Oliver Twists , and their association in the Bill with the Minister of Labour rather casts the Minister of Labour for another Dickensian character — the Artful Dodger — and the Minister , I think , is justifying himself in the habits which that gentleman had in his behaviour in this Bill as regards the depressed areas .
