# text = That is the new position and , in view of it , is the Secretary of State not right , is he not acting as a realist in turning in the direction of another form of land settlement , that is to say , in the same direction which , as my hon . Friends and I discovered , has been followed in Germany , Belgium , Holland and other countries ?
