# text = It is to prevent the hardship which arises to the injured man in the case of the bankruptcy of an employer who is not insured , but what this Bill proposes is to apply over the whole field of industry the provisions of a Measure which was specially applied to the mining industry and which , I hope , dealt with the matter satisfactorily in the case of that industry .
