# text_id = 1912
# text = I think that probably I appreciate the point as well as the hon . Member but the object of this Amendment , as we shall doubtless learn from the hon . Member when he addresses the Committee , is to ensure that instead of the same days being fixed for the tracks in Birmingham , or any other centre , each track is to have its racing days fixed differently .
