# text_id = 1914
# text = The position is that this Clause creates a new statutory offence — a misdemeanour in one case , and in another case a statutory offence liable to a fine of £ 100 on any master or owner of a British vessel who refuses within Spanish territorial waters to allow a German or an Italian officer to board his ship and do the various matters which are detailed in this Clause .
