# text_id = 1915
# text = I believe that if this co-ordination were arranged it might be possible , even in the present circumstances in the particular case with which I am dealing at the moment to ascertain some existing requirement in one or other of the State Departments which would enable my hon . Friend to avoid having to make a change — to enable him to cancel or suspend or modify the change contemplated .
