# text_id = 1916
# text = My impression is that if such a change were made here , a similar change would be demanded in the House of Commons and that it would be objected to — this is only a conjecture ; it is not founded on any knowledge — on the ground that it would throw additional burdens on the occupant of the Chair , whether he were the Speaker or the Chairman of Committees .
