# text_id = 1919
# text = That is the last thing in the world that we have in mind ; but inasmuch as there is this perfectly definite difference between the legal advisers of the two parties concerned , while I agree with the noble Earl that the best thing I can do now is to withdraw the Amendment , I do not give up hope of negotiating an agreement with the Minister of Mines .
