# text_id = 1920
# text = I have in my possession , and I would not part with it for worlds , a certificate issued by the local authority telling the world that George Tomlinson , at 11 years of age , had put in so many thousand attendances in the course of seven years at school and now , on the authority of the urban district council of that district , had received beneficial employment .
