# text_id = 1921
# text = It is suggested in the evening paper that they have serious differences in their ranks , and they may have been away endeavouring to compose them ; but we hope that , in spite of this poor attendance during the Debate on a Motion of Censure , the Chancellor of the Exchequer will have been sufficiently advised as to what has happened during his long absence to enable him to reply .
