# text = At the same time I was interested in a speech by the hon . Member for Barrow - in - Furness ( Sir J. Walker - Smith ) on housing when he told the Government — and he gave a great number of figures in proof of it — that the best thing they could do for industry — the building or any other industry — was to let it alone .
