# text = I believe that there are about 100 hon . Members who fear that the result will be an increase in the number of accidents , but if the Minister finds that the number increases in consequence of the abolition of the speed limit , I hope that he will take his courage in both hands , and come to the House with a proposal to impose another speed limit .
