# text_id = 1928
# text = I may claim that it is universally recognised that in present circumstances an Account of this kind , of which we were pioneers , is essential ; that if it is to exist at all and operate successfully its resources must be ample , and nothing could encourage more that speculation which it is the object of the Account to defeat than the suspicion that this was not the case .
