# text = I would also draw attention to the fact that the vocational training centres of the Army , which have been in operation practically since the War , have built up a great technique , not only of understanding soldiers , but of getting posts and contracts , which I am afraid will be lost to the soldiers , because of their having been isolated for some years from ordinary civilian life .
