# text = If the occupiers of more than one half in number of the separate parts of the building assent to the scheme , then , when the scheme is carried out , the cost can be added by the owner to the rents , not merely of those who have agreed , but of all the occupiers of different parts of the building , proportionately to what they are already paying .
