# text_id = 1939
# text = If it be found necessary to offer such an inducement , why not have a comprehensive scheme , so that all forms of property are assured of some measure of protection — I will put it no higher than that — instead of being fobbed off by the Chancellor 's somewhat indeterminate assurances and by a repetition of the Government 's familiar technique of the appointment of a committee of inquiry ?
