# text_id = 1943
# text = At the time the marriage allowance was introduced last year , one of the main reasons why the Admiralty responded to the demand which had been repeatedly made was that in the other two fighting services there was in one form or another some kind of marriage allowance , although in no other service of the Crown is any such differentiation made between the emoluments of bachelors and married officers .
