# text = There are drainage schemes worked out by competent engineers , many of them in great detail , which would employ many thousands of men , but except here and there , where bits of grants are thrown to them if the Chairman of a catchment area board makes himself rather too much of a nuisance , none of the money so urgently required for these schemes is really let out .
