# text = The Government have admitted in the part of the Clause with which we have already dealt the principle under which they are to be allowed to continue to manufacture omnibus bodies , and I presume that they are to be permitted to do it because they make the best omnibus bodies in the world , and that that is a good reason why they should go on doing it .
