# text = The Minister of Labour , in her speech , so far as I can remember , brought out only one new fact and that was that there was a figure of 67,000 people who had come upon the live registers of the Exchanges , not all receiving benefit but who were upon the register as a result of the changes of administration that have been brought about under the last Act .
