# text = Mention of the word " point " reminds me that my hon . and gallant Friend the Member for Gainsborough ( Captain Crookshank ) , no doubt for the purpose of denying a charge which I had not in fact made , namely , that he ended his speech without making a point , said that he had ended his speech with a very good point , namely , myself .
