# text = I think it is a great pity that such a subject , which concerns so many people in this country , should be dealt with in that way , and that we should merely be told that where - as there were 108,000 convictions and 57,000 endorsements in 1935 and 142,000 convictions and 75,000 endorsements in 1936 , if we had greater uniformity all the licences would be endorsed .
