# text_id = 1957
# text = I think it is the best housing Bill we have had since the War finished , and I hope that it will fulfil the predictions of the Minister and the Parliamentary Secretary and of those who have spoken so optimistically of it , and that it will he the beginning of a , solution of our housing and slum problem which has perplexed this country for so many years past .
