# text_id = 1960
# text = We are discussing the duty on the remainder , and the additional revenue from the duty , if the Clause to which I am speaking is added to the Bill , will amount to approximately £ 10,000 in a full year , adding at most one halfpenny per square foot on the price of patent leather — not one halfpenny per pair of shoes but a halfpenny per square foot .
