# text_id = 1961
# text = When all the loyal members of the League have agreed to apply economic , diplomatic or other sanctions to an aggressor nation , and it is found that the nation in question is stronger than all the loyal members of the League , in so far as these economic , diplomatic or other sanctions are concerned , then , in the last resort , the League would have to use force .
