# text = I cannot conceive of anything more wholesome for all concerned ; for whatever views those of us who went into the ranks in the last War , and served for more than two years in them , had of the War , it is certainly true that none of us would forego the experience he had of being in the barrack - room with other people of all sorts and conditions .
