# text = He dealt with Japan , and what he said was the subject of much comment , because everyone knows that the Japanese have increased their export trade of late to an enormous degree , and everyone knows also that it is due mainly to currency changes , to the fact that the yen has dropped to half its value , that there is an enormous bonus on all exports from Japan .
