# text = The road tests which are given under the Act of 1930 in the case of disabled persons are not of the slightest use , and I hope that the Minister when he makes regulations will not give the same tests which are at present given under the 1930 Act , but will have a proper oral examination as to whether the driver knows the essence of driving a motor car .
